:\"/factory-tour\",\"children\":\"FACTORY TOUR\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"FAQ\",{\"href\":\"/faq\",\"children\":\"FAQ\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"RESOURCES\",{\"href\":\"/resources\",\"children\":\"RESOURCES\"}]]]}]],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"CONTACT\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Jebel+Ali+Industrial+Area+1+Dubai\",\"data-testid\":\"footer-map-link\",\"children\":\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1, Dubai, UAE\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"tel:+97142585754\",\"data-testid\":\"footer-phone-link\",\"children\":\"+971 4 258 5754\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"mailto:sales@brightluxx.com\",\"data-testid\":\"footer-email-link\",\"children\":\"sales@brightluxx.com\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"site-footer__bottom\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" BRIGHTLUXX. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"A DIVISION OF IHG INDUSTRY L.L.C\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{}]]}]}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[\"$L9\",null,[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$b\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@c\"}]}]]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,\"$d\"]},null,false,null],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"children\":\"$Lf\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$b\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L11\"}]}]}],null]}],false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$12\",[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]]],\"S\":true,\"h\":null,\"r\":\"$undefined\",\"s\":\"$undefined\",\"a\":\"$undefined\",\"l\":\"$undefined\",\"p\":\"$undefined\",\"d\":\"$undefined\",\"b\":\"Imuj_2AFTFb5vAkEMopsc\"}\nd:C\n13:Td50,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is pixel pitch and why is it important for LED displays in Dubai?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pixel pitch refers to the distance in millimeters between the centers of two adjacent LED clusters. It is crucial because it determines the display's resolution and clarity, especially important in Dubai and GCC regions where high-quality visuals are essential for corporate, retail, and outdoor advertising applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I choose the right pixel pitch for an indoor LED display in the UAE?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"To select the optimal pixel pitch for indoor use in the UAE, consider the typical viewing distance and application environment. For example, corporate meeting rooms usually require a pixel pitch between P1.2 to P1.9, ensuring clear visibility from 1.8 to 3.5 meters. Also, factor in content type and budget to balance cost and display quality.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why should outdoor billboards in the GCC use a higher pixel pitch like P6 to P10?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Outdoor billboards in the GCC require larger pixel pitches, such as P6 to P10, because viewers are typically farther away\\u2014such as drivers on highways. This ensures visibility from a distance, durability against harsh weather, and compliance with local regulatory standards for outdoor digital signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does pixel pitch affect the cost of LED displays in the Middle East market?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Smaller pixel pitches (e.g., P0.9 to P1.5) offer higher resolution but come at a higher manufacturing and installation cost, making them ideal for control rooms or close-range viewing. In contrast, larger pitches (P6+) reduce costs and are suitable for outdoor advertising in GCC countries where viewing distances are longer.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the recommended viewing distance formula for selecting pixel pitch in GCC countries?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A widely accepted rule in the GCC market is to multiply the pixel pitch value by 1.5 to 2 to determine the minimum comfortable viewing distance in meters. For instance, a P2.5 LED display should be viewed from 3.75 to 5 meters to ensure optimal clarity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the harsh weather conditions in UAE affect pixel pitch choice for outdoor LED screens?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, extreme heat, dust, and humidity in the UAE necessitate LED displays with larger pixel pitches and robust protective enclosures. This ensures longevity and consistent performance, making P6 to P10 pixel pitch displays more suitable for outdoor environments in the Middle East.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does pixel pitch impact the type of content displayed on LED signage in Gulf countries?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Smaller pixel pitches enable fine detail and are preferred for content with text, fine graphics, or video playback in close-viewing environments like control rooms or corporate offices. Larger pitches suit less detailed content such as billboards and public information signs viewed from a distance commonly found in Gulf cities.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Article\\\", \\\"headline\\\": \\\"The Complete Guide to Choosing the Right Pixel Pitch\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"How to select the optimal pixel pitch for your LED display based on viewing distance, content type, budget, and application environment.\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/choosing-pixel-pitch-guide\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/downloaded-images_blog_4a7ef971_the-complete-guide-t.jpg\\\", \\\"author\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"publisher\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"datePublished\\\": \\\"2026-03-11\\\", \\\"dateModified\\\": \\\"2026-08-09\\\", \\\"articleSection\\\": \\\"LED Display Technology\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\"],\"$L17\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Blog\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"The Complete Guide to Choosing the Right Pixel Pitch\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/choosing-pixel-pitch-guide\\\"}]}\"}}]\n15:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n18:Tbdb,<h1>The Complete Guide to Choosing the Right Pixel Pitch</h1><p>Blog — Choosing Pixel Pitch Guide. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>How to select the optimal pixel pitch for your LED display based on viewing distance, content type, budget, and application environment.</p><div><h2>Understanding Pixel Pitch</h2>\n<p>Pixel pitch is the distance in millimeters between the center of one LED cluster to the center of the next. It's the single most important specification when selecting an LED display.</p>\n\n<h3>The Viewing Distance Formula</h3>\n<p>A simple rule of thumb: multiply the pixel pitch by 1.5-2 to get the minimum comfortable viewing distance in meters. For a P2.5 display, the minimum viewing distance is approximately 3.75-5 meters.</p>\n\n<h3>Application-Based Recommendations</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Control Rooms:</strong> P0.9 - P1.5 (operators sitting 1-3m away)</li>\n<li><strong>Corporate Meeting Rooms:</strong> P1.2 - P1.9</li>\n<li><strong>Retail (Indoor):</strong> P2.5 - P3.9</li>\n<li><strong>Outdoor Billboards:</strong> P6 - P10 (depending on road speed)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Budget vs Quality Trade-offs</h3>\n<p>Smaller pixel pitch means more LEDs per square meter, which increases cost. Don't overspend on unnecessary resolution—a P1.2 display viewed from 10 meters away won't look better than a P2.5.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is pixel pitch and why is it important for LED displays in Dubai?</h3><p>Pixel pitch refers to the distance in millimeters between the centers of two adjacent LED clusters. It is crucial because it determines the display's resolution and clarity, especially important in Dubai and GCC regions where high-quality visuals are essential for corporate, retail, and outdoor advertising applications.</p><h3>How do I choose the right pixel pitch for an indoor LED display in the UAE?</h3><p>To select the optimal pixel pitch for indoor use in the UAE, consider the typical viewing distance and application environment. For example, corporate meeting rooms usually require a pixel pitch between P1.2 to P1.9, ensuring clear visibility from 1.8 to 3.5 meters. Also, factor in content type and budget to balance cost and display quality.</p><h3>Why should outdoor billboards in the GCC use a higher pixel pitch like P6 to P10?</h3><p>Outdoor billboards in the GCC require larger pixel pitches, such as P6 to P10, because viewers are typically farther away—such as drivers on highways. This ensures visibility from a distance, durability against harsh weather, and compliance with local regulatory standards for outdoor digital signage.</p><h3>How does pixel pitch affect the cost of LED displays in the Middle East market?</h3><p>Smaller pixel pitches (e.g., P0.9 to P1.5) offer higher resolution but come at a higher manufacturing and installation cost, making them ideal for control rooms or close-range viewing. In contrast, larger pitches (P6+) reduce costs and are suitable for outdoor advertising in GCC countries where viewing distances are longer.</p>17:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$18\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Blog — Choosing Pixel Pitch Guide | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Blog — Choosing Pixel Pitch Guide. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/choosing-pixel-pitch-guide\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:Td50,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is pixel pitch and why is it important for LED displays in Dubai?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pixel pitch refers to the distance in millimeters between the centers of two adjacent LED clusters. It is crucial because it determines the display's resolution and clarity, especially important in Dubai and GCC regions where high-quality visuals are essential for corporate, retail, and outdoor advertising applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I choose the right pixel pitch for an indoor LED display in the UAE?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"To select the optimal pixel pitch for indoor use in the UAE, consider the typical viewing distance and application environment. For example, corporate meeting rooms usually require a pixel pitch between P1.2 to P1.9, ensuring clear visibility from 1.8 to 3.5 meters. Also, factor in content type and budget to balance cost and display quality.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why should outdoor billboards in the GCC use a higher pixel pitch like P6 to P10?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Outdoor billboards in the GCC require larger pixel pitches, such as P6 to P10, because viewers are typically farther away\\u2014such as drivers on highways. This ensures visibility from a distance, durability against harsh weather, and compliance with local regulatory standards for outdoor digital signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does pixel pitch affect the cost of LED displays in the Middle East market?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Smaller pixel pitches (e.g., P0.9 to P1.5) offer higher resolution but come at a higher manufacturing and installation cost, making them ideal for control rooms or close-range viewing. In contrast, larger pitches (P6+) reduce costs and are suitable for outdoor advertising in GCC countries where viewing distances are longer.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the recommended viewing distance formula for selecting pixel pitch in GCC countries?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A widely accepted rule in the GCC market is to multiply the pixel pitch value by 1.5 to 2 to determine the minimum comfortable viewing distance in meters. For instance, a P2.5 LED display should be viewed from 3.75 to 5 meters to ensure optimal clarity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the harsh weather conditions in UAE affect pixel pitch choice for outdoor LED screens?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, extreme heat, dust, and humidity in the UAE necessitate LED displays with larger pixel pitches and robust protective enclosures. This ensures longevity and consistent performance, making P6 to P10 pixel pitch displays more suitable for outdoor environments in the Middle East.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does pixel pitch impact the type of content displayed on LED signage in Gulf countries?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Smaller pixel pitches enable fine detail and are preferred for content with text, fine graphics, or video playback in close-viewing environments like control rooms or corporate offices. Larger pitches suit less detailed content such as billboards and public information signs viewed from a distance commonly found in Gulf cities.\"}}]}9:X\ne:X\ne:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"Imuj_2AFTFb5vAkEMopsc\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Article\\\", \\\"headline\\\": \\\"The Complete Guide to Choosing the Right Pixel Pitch\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"How to select the optimal pixel pitch for your LED display based on viewing distance, content type, budget, and application environment.\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/choosing-pixel-pitch-guide\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/downloaded-images_blog_4a7ef971_the-complete-guide-t.jpg\\\", \\\"author\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"publisher\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"datePublished\\\": \\\"2026-03-11\\\", \\\"dateModified\\\": \\\"2026-08-09\\\", \\\"articleSection\\\": \\\"LED Display Technology\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\"],\"$L6\"]}],null,\"$L7\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@8\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$La\",\"isPartial\":\"$@b\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lc\",\"isPartial\":\"$@d\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":\"$e\"},{\"rsc\":\"$Lf\",\"isPartial\":\"$@10\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@11\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@12\"}\n14:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n15:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n17:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n18:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n19:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n1a:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n1b:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n1c:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n1d:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"\"]\n1e:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"FloatingActions\"]\n1f:I[81888,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"CookieConsent\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\",\"image\"]\n3:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Blog\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"The Complete Guide to Choosing the Right Pixel Pitch\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/choosing-pixel-pitch-guide\\\"}]}\"}}]\n4:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n5:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n13:Tbdb,<h1>The Complete Guide to Choosing the Right Pixel Pitch</h1><p>Blog — Choosing Pixel Pitch Guide. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>How to select the optimal pixel pitch for your LED display based on viewing distance, content type, budget, and application environment.</p><div><h2>Understanding Pixel Pitch</h2>\n<p>Pixel pitch is the distance in millimeters between the center of one LED cluster to the center of the next. It's the single most important specification when selecting an LED display.</p>\n\n<h3>The Viewing Distance Formula</h3>\n<p>A simple rule of thumb: multiply the pixel pitch by 1.5-2 to get the minimum comfortable viewing distance in meters. For a P2.5 display, the minimum viewing distance is approximately 3.75-5 meters.</p>\n\n<h3>Application-Based Recommendations</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Control Rooms:</strong> P0.9 - P1.5 (operators sitting 1-3m away)</li>\n<li><strong>Corporate Meeting Rooms:</strong> P1.2 - P1.9</li>\n<li><strong>Retail (Indoor):</strong> P2.5 - P3.9</li>\n<li><strong>Outdoor Billboards:</strong> P6 - P10 (depending on road speed)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Budget vs Quality Trade-offs</h3>\n<p>Smaller pixel pitch means more LEDs per square meter, which increases cost. Don't overspend on unnecessary resolution—a P1.2 display viewed from 10 meters away won't look better than a P2.5.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is pixel pitch and why is it important for LED displays in Dubai?</h3><p>Pixel pitch refers to the distance in millimeters between the centers of two adjacent LED clusters. It is crucial because it determines the display's resolution and clarity, especially important in Dubai and GCC regions where high-quality visuals are essential for corporate, retail, and outdoor advertising applications.</p><h3>How do I choose the right pixel pitch for an indoor LED display in the UAE?</h3><p>To select the optimal pixel pitch for indoor use in the UAE, consider the typical viewing distance and application environment. For example, corporate meeting rooms usually require a pixel pitch between P1.2 to P1.9, ensuring clear visibility from 1.8 to 3.5 meters. Also, factor in content type and budget to balance cost and display quality.</p><h3>Why should outdoor billboards in the GCC use a higher pixel pitch like P6 to P10?</h3><p>Outdoor billboards in the GCC require larger pixel pitches, such as P6 to P10, because viewers are typically farther away—such as drivers on highways. This ensures visibility from a distance, durability against harsh weather, and compliance with local regulatory standards for outdoor digital signage.</p><h3>How does pixel pitch affect the cost of LED displays in the Middle East market?</h3><p>Smaller pixel pitches (e.g., P0.9 to P1.5) offer higher resolution but come at a higher manufacturing and installation cost, making them ideal for control rooms or close-range viewing. In contrast, larger pitches (P6+) reduce costs and are suitable for outdoor advertising in GCC countries where viewing distances are longer.</p>6:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}]\n7:[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$15\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@16\"}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$15\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Blog — Choosing Pixel Pitch Guide | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Blog — Choosing Pixel Pitch Guide. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/choosing-pixel-pitch-guide\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{}]}]]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\"